OL,14,G0432 In the Studio
OL,15,     FMost artists depict light. James
OL,16,     FTurrell works with light, that is
OL,17,     Fthe material for his famous
OL,18,     FSkyspaces. We join him working on
OL,19,     Fhis latest, a monumental work in
OL,20,     FAarhus, Denmark.
